Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:06.56,TL,,0,0,0,,做过世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}的斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:10.51,TL,,0,0,0,,偏偏有一个人 她一次都没赢过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:19.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a reaction to match, Jelena Ostapenko!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛点拿下 看奥斯塔彭科的反应！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:20.51,TL,,0,0,0,,伯明翰草地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:22.98,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}18{\fs68}岁的资格赛选手斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:25.00,TL,,0,0,0,,遇上法网冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:26.52,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:30.09,TL,,0,0,0,,全场接发球{\fs78}38{\fs68}分拿下{\fs78}24{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:33.52,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2021{\fs68}年印第安维尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2{\fs68}号种子斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:44.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ostapenko breaks. What a first set from Jelena Ostapenko.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科破发！首盘打得太漂亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:48.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 两盘出局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.06,0:00:50.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年迪拜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:52.95,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克先拿一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.86,0:00:58.10,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 奥斯塔彭科先破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.86,0:01:03.24,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 斯瓦泰克被逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:09.01,TL,,0,0,0,,这是她{\fs78}37{\fs68}连胜前 最后一场失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:12.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2023{\fs68}年美网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:16.27,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克是卫冕冠军 也是世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:18.53,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:21.11,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科随即提速
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.59,TL,,0,0,0,,奥斯塔彭科说 打得又快又狠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:26.80,TL,,0,0,0,,斯瓦泰克就有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.82,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:41.41,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, Jelena Ostapenko stuns number one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科爆冷击败世界第一！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:44.45,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}75{\fs68}周的世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.45,0:01:47.85,TL,,0,0,0,,她说 突然间 我失去了控制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.26,0:01:49.70,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年多哈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:52.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}届卫冕冠军斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:58.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm just trying to think the last time Swiatek lost a match winning just four games.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她上次只拿四局就输球 是何时？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.21,0:02:03.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She has the winning formula against Swiatek,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她有赢斯瓦泰克的公式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:07.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as the three-time champion is brushed aside.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N三届冠军被扫地出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:12.02,TL,,0,0,0,,同年斯图加特 斯瓦泰克扳回一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.41,0:02:15.38,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 还是她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:21.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a sensational six in a row{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N惊人的六连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.26,0:02:25.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for Jelena Ostapenko against Iga Swiatek.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N奥斯塔彭科对斯瓦泰克！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:29.17,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉这一周 两人只可能在决赛碰面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:37.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the final point goes Iga Swiatek's way.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最后一分 属于斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:40.26,TL,,0,0,0,,克星续写 还是破局？
